Package: oofind
Version: 0.2.1-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Capability-bounded file finding utility
 A capability-bounded file finding utility written in pure openOODA,
 featuring fast recursive traversal, glob matching, JSON output
 streaming, and an agent-native MCP stdio surface.
